  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.warm_correction",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "注意哈，价款题最可惜的丢分，往往不是算术错，而是口径先错。今天只练一个动作：把进度款题先写成四口径资金链。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 10.92,
      "requestId": "ffe51abb-fc1f-956c-943a-d2b6f38b3c1d",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "trap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.wrong_idea",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先停手。含税、累计、暂列金、前期已付，都可能把这道题带偏。直接套公式，会把钱算到另一条链上。",
      "startSec": 11.32,
      "durSec": 9.552,
      "requestId": "786ecaca-0ef4-986e-9df0-1000695e7275",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "four_mouth",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "main_exam_action",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先判哪笔钱：预付款、进度款、结算款，还是质保金。再锁量价、时点和扣减。四个口径缺一，整条链都错。",
      "startSec": 21.272,
      "durSec": 10.68,
      "requestId": "7edf57ee-bf2d-9509-bb5e-070a71d2719f",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "advance",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "visual_library.advance.nodes[advance_base].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "预付款先看基数。按题干，从合同价里扣掉暂列金额，再乘预付比例。",
      "startSec": 32.352,
      "durSec": 6.744,
      "requestId": "bbc35e5b-2363-9e74-81ac-77fe6eb23d98",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "advance",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "visual_library.advance.nodes[deduction_point].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "起扣点不是固定百分比。公式是合同价减去预付款除以主要材料占比。材料占比必须看题干给值。",
      "startSec": 39.496,
      "durSec": 8.928,
      "requestId": "1b092f0a-2570-9c52-afdd-7b00f9c662e4",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "advance",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "visual_library.advance.nodes[trigger].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "累计完成达到起扣点以后，才开始逐步扣回预付款。",
      "startSec": 48.824,
      "durSec": 4.824,
      "requestId": "3573c507-e711-91e6-b636-9e891c6f0109",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "progress",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "visual_library.progress.nodes[pay_formula].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "进度款别只看当月。先算累计应得，再倒扣累计预付款扣回、前期已付和发包人扣款，剩下才是本期实付。",
      "startSec": 54.048,
      "durSec": 10.008,
      "requestId": "d401bf60-ed4d-9d57-badc-de2682426af2",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "limits",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "visual_library.limits.nodes[floor80].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "两条红线要单独写。没有约定支付比例时，不宜低于累计完成工程价款的百分之八十。",
      "startSec": 64.456,
      "durSec": 7.776,
      "requestId": "a140b1de-99c5-98a6-9a50-1495e726a2e6",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "limits",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "visual_library.limits.nodes[retention3].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "质保金看结算总价，累计预留不得超过百分之三。别把基数换成合同价或当期款。",
      "startSec": 72.632,
      "durSec": 7.416,
      "requestId": "f8f99069-152e-9c2c-b7e9-968c92209cc1",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.exam_phrase",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "答题纸上，先写口径，再写公式。标准动作是：判哪笔钱，写量价和累计时点，说明扣回规则，最后落到当期实付。",
      "startSec": 80.448,
      "durSec": 11.376,
      "requestId": "a30cfffc-471c-9601-8038-21d82abc90ce",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_boundary",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，那我看见合同价和比例，直接一乘不就得了吗？",
      "startSec": 92.224,
      "durSec": 5.232,
      "requestId": "ab004d6e-9959-9605-9b02-5b2bb573ad4a",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_boundary",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "main_exam_action",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不行。你得先判这到底是哪笔钱，再看量价、时点和扣减。钱的口径没判，公式越熟越容易算偏。",
      "startSec": 97.856,
      "durSec": 8.856,
      "requestId": "488572fe-dcb1-9f83-82c8-15ed7079b878",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_boundary",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那预付款起扣点，我是不是背个固定比例就完事儿？",
      "startSec": 107.112,
      "durSec": 3.912,
      "requestId": "6ee0d8c1-2d73-9d3b-9145-c84f2a35c4bd",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_boundary",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "visual_library.advance.nodes[deduction_point].text",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不是。起扣点要看合同价、预付款和主要材料占比。题干给什么占比，就用什么占比。",
      "startSec": 111.424,
      "durSec": 7.656,
      "requestId": "a3a0dd82-76bd-961c-9695-984abddcef5a",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_boundary",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "我把公式写出来，是不是就够用了？",
      "startSec": 119.48,
      "durSec": 3.912,
      "requestId": "00c8f836-ab6f-9135-ad14-6c415119dfb2",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_boundary",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.exam_phrase",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "还差一句采分表达。考试不是只看公式，要让阅卷人看见你先判口径、再扣回、最后落到当期实付。",
      "startSec": 123.792,
      "durSec": 9.6,
      "requestId": "d03316e6-e692-977c-9fd5-4023434084ef",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing_challenge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.warm_correction",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后收束一句哈：价款题别先抢公式，先把钱链走顺。现在进闯关，换个题干看你能不能稳住口径。",
      "startSec": 133.792,
      "durSec": 9.144,
      "requestId": "ca783b11-31db-92ed-8f04-ec54b9e2f8da",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}
